   "source": [
    "# Python with ATLAS Go — 20 hands-on lessons\n",
    "Read the complete guide: https://github.com/FUllSCIPTS/ATLAS/blob/main/docs/PYTHON_PROGRAMMING.md\n",
    "P01–P19 show computed/count data; P20 measures runtime in milliseconds. All figures and CSVs arise from the executed code.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import importlib.util, pathlib, urllib.request, sys\n",
    "from IPython.display import display, Image\n",
    "url='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FUllSCIPTS/ATLAS/main/python_lab/experiments.py'\n",
    "path=pathlib.Path('python_experiments.py')\n",
    "urllib.request.urlretrieve(url,path)\n",
    "spec=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location('python_experiments',path)\n",
    "plab=importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec); spec.loader.exec_module(plab)\n",
    "plab.self_test()\n",
    "OUT=pathlib.Path('python_results'); OUT.mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n",
    "print('Loaded',len(plab.LABS),'Python lessons')\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def run_lesson(number):\n",
    "    result=plab.experiment(number)\n",
    "    picture=plab.save_experiment(result,OUT)\n",
    "    print('Lesson',number,result['title'],'| unit:',result['unit'],'| sample:',result['rows'][-1])\n",
    "    display(Image(filename=str(picture)))\n",
    "    return result\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## P01 — Python setup, print and comments\n",
    "**Concept:** Python executes statements from top to bottom. Notebook cells share a Python runtime. Indentation defines blocks.\n",
    "**ATLAS Go:** AtlasGoApp.build in app.py. [Browse UML method catalogue](https://github.com/FUllSCIPTS/ATLAS/blob/main/android-app/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#complete-source-method-catalog).\n",
    "**Discuss:** Why does the plotted output change with n? What is its unit? Try an edge case.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "result_1=run_lesson(1)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
